-- DB update 2026_09_05_33 -> 2026_09_05_34
--
-- Shape-based itemization (docs/itemization-phase-2.md), advance work on implementation order
-- step 11: recompute dps_delta for every already-assigned real weapon so its final DPS
-- (WeaponDpsCurve(ilvl, quality) + dps_delta) still matches that item's ORIGINAL Blizzard DPS as
-- closely as possible, against the refit curve (rev_1788605982739495136.sql, same batch) and the
-- new item_weapon_dps_cost (7.0, see the step-9 pending file) -- an "initial draft" faithful
-- reproduction pass, before the §7.7 caster-refund rule gets layered on top of these numbers.
--
-- *** TARGETS item_itemization, NOT item_budget_assign -- must apply AFTER the rename migration
-- (rev_1788602621364618840.sql) in the same batch, same "hold the restart" rule as everything
-- else touching that table. This file's timestamp already sorts after it. ***
--
-- "Original DPS" is pulled from data/sql/base/db_world/item_template.sql (the untouched stock
-- dump), NOT the live item_template -- the earlier Bucket 1-4 catalog conversion already
-- overwrote dmg_min1/dmg_max1 for a large share of these weapons in place (confirmed: e.g.
-- Bonereaver's Edge, entry 17076, is 206/310 in the base dump but 180.594/335.39 live), so the
-- live DB is no longer a reliable source of "what this weapon originally was."
--
-- Scope: the 2,065 of 2,119 currently-assigned real weapons (entry <= 56806, class 2, Quality
-- Rare/Epic) that still resolve against the pristine base dump (a handful of entries didn't
-- join cleanly, left untouched here). The 398 real Rare/Epic weapons with no item_itemization
-- row at all are out of scope for this pass -- assigning them a primary/secondary shape and a
-- row in the first place is the rest of step 11, not this one.
--
-- primary_shape_id/secondary_shape_id/primary_share/block_value_delta are written at their
-- step-5 placeholder defaults (0/0/6000/0) here -- shape assignment for these items is still
-- pending, the rest of step 11's migration. budget_mult/stamina_delta/absorbed_spell_slots/
-- armor_delta are carried forward UNCHANGED from their current item_budget_assign values; only
-- dps_delta actually changes in this pass.
--
